	(text "Board-to-board header J10 (J_PWR) and charger host pull-ups" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 184.15 26.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid "c54c7950-04be-5a85-a097-549d87a3e1d1"))
	(text "J10 mating side (pin map: hardware/ARCHITECTURE.md). +3V3 lives here: CE pull-up R20 1M (charge off until firmware writes VREG; the power board has its own 1M), INT R22 10k,\ncharger I2C R54/R55 10k (BQ25798 table 5-1)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 184.15 31.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8af6cf7c-731a-5353-9889-e0da84f59a4b"))
	(text "J10 pin map (hardware/ARCHITECTURE.md), keyed 2x10: pin 3 is the key (no pin, hole blocked)\npins 1, 2: SYS, power board -> main board: system rail (cell-referred, 1.8-5.5 V), at least 1 A\npins 4, 5, 6, 9, 10, 13, 14, 17, 18: GND (a GND pair between every signal pair)\npins 7, 8: USB_DP, USB_DN, main -> power: BC1.2 detection only (BQ25798 D+/D-)\npins 11, 12: CHG_SDA, CHG_SCL: charger I2C (address 0x6B), 10k pull-ups on the main board\npin 15: CHG_INT, power -> main: open drain, 10k pull-up on the main board\npin 16: CHG_CE, main -> power: active low, pulled high (charge off) until firmware drives it low\npins 19, 20: USB_VBUS, main -> power: USB-C VBUS to ACFET1 drain and VAC1\nRotated, mirrored or column-shifted plugs hit the key (tools/header_check.py). No 3.3 V on the power board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 193.04 99.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b954ac1d-bd98-545c-a6ad-040665e52136"))
